        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bean Quest</i></strong> is a game about collecting items and beating progressively harder missions and enemy's. Collect a variety of weapons, and different armor sets. This game revolves around campaigns, that have multiple missions in them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features in <i><strong>Bean Quest</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of weapons with different types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different armor sets with varying stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity system that allows better stats on the same item</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player stats including: Health, Experience Points (XP), Gold, and More coming soon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system to build your own house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops system to buy, transfer, or unlock more items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main lobby includes<i> Districts</i> that the player can enter to do a variety of things. At this point, the main districts includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training District</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions District</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing District</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops District</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial District</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still very early in development and more is coming soon!</p>",
